{
  "_comment": "Proxmox lab: a three-node Proxmox VE cluster (proxmox-ve, proxmox-ve-node2, proxmox-ve-node3: ZFS mirror over two virtio disks each, automated installer; corosync over the pve-lan segment) and proxmox-lab-client (Debian Xfce + Firefox). Every VM has a NAT NIC for SSH/internet and a second NIC on pve-lan (10.10.10.0/24); node 1 also runs two community-scripts LXC apps. vmctl group install proxmox-lab installs what is missing, starts the stack and forms the cluster; vmctl group map proxmox-lab --open draws it with the commands.",
